// Per-hardware-BTB-level outcome stats.  Fired in bp_predict_btb() for every
// CF branch (excluding CF_ICO, CF_RET, BAR_FETCH, CF_SYS).  The
// INCORRECT_BUT_TARGET_CORRECT bucket is the no-entry/fallthrough-correct case.
// L0/L1 stats are only fired when BTB_L0_PRESENT / BTB_L1_PRESENT.
